    "name": {
      "value": "Legacy of the Hammer"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "da"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Your introduction to the criminal life was spurred forward by a seemingly innocuous hammer that provided you with all kinds of innovative criminal ideas. It has since left your possession, but every now and then you hear a faint whisper urging you toward crime.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Thievery skill and Engineering Lore. You gain the Concealing Legerdemain skill feat."
    },
